<title>USA: Marcus sets dividend reinvestment plan.</title>
<headline>Marcus sets dividend reinvestment plan.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marcus Corp said Friday it is introducing a dividend reinvestment and stock purchase plan for shareholders and associates.</p>
<p>Marcus earlier this year changed to quarterly payments from annual dividend payments.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
